<!--Post: 12141--><!--Time: 1111643276-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12141"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><a href="mailto:vscantu1@msn.com" target="_blank"><!--/email--><!--name-->Vscantu<!--/name--></b></a>
</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Vscantu<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, March 23, 2005 - 9:47 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->CLARIFICATION: <BR> <BR>Tho&#39; this thread is titled &#34;FROM LAW ENFORCEMENT to this Board&#34;, it was meant as a forum for both questions FOR law enforcement &#40;from us&#41;, as well as their answers FROM law enforcement. <BR> <BR>Sorry for the confusion, but I wanted to catch the eye of law enforcement personel, and make this stand out to them, since there are already a jillion threads on this board.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12141-->
<!--Post: 12179--><!--Time: 1111715021-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12179"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Embersage<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, March 24, 2005 - 5:43 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I have a question, Since all of the recent murders, sex offenses, crime, I here the the government is talking about putting the letter Y on Driver&#39;s License of sex offender&#39;s etc. I have a better idea. Tell me what you think. What if we take those microchips that were created to keep track of our pets, and now our children and instead, implant them into known criminals. Then we would know where THEY were all the time. Forget the ankle bracelets, this would be cheaper.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12179-->
<!--Post: 12202--><!--Time: 1111763937-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12202"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 7:18 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Emb- THAT is a FABULOUS idea!..... <BR>THEY need to be chipped...to hell with their rights...our children and other citizens have rights to...to be protected from these insane individuals...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12202-->
<!--Post: 12203--><!--Time: 1111764006-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST12203"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Elsewhere<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Elsewhere<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->10-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, March 25, 2005 - 7:20 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I said the thing about the &#34;rights&#34; because I figure that will be the &#34;argument&#34; that it is unconstitutional to know their whereabouts &#34;at alllll times&#34; <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 12203-->
